{"v":4,"catch":"最尖端的2.5D對戰格鬥遊戲終於在Nintendo Switch™登場！","desc":"全球超過300萬名玩家的《聖騎士之戰》系列最新作品《聖騎士之戰 -奮戰-》，在此推出網羅28名角色的《聖騎士之戰 -奮戰-Nintendo Switch™版》！\n\n■可在Nintendo Switch上享受沿襲動畫的精緻畫面！\n重現宛如動畫般精緻的畫面，連細節也栩栩如生。\n可透過Nintendo Switch的TV模式、桌上模式、手提模式等3種遊玩模式，享受令人沉浸其中的刺激戰鬥體驗。\n\n■搭載Rollback功能，可進行流暢的線上對戰！\n本作搭載Rollback Netcode，能與遠方的玩家進行流暢的線上對戰，免除延遲問題。\n\n■超過6小時的劇情模式！\n主線劇情以全3D動畫描繪至系列作主角「索爾＝巴德凱」的故事結局，還有豐富的Another Story描繪發生在主線之外的事件。\n\n■總計28名多樣化的角色參戰！\n可遊玩多達28名角色，屬系列作之最。","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2026-04-30","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 網路 2 人","langs":["中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 16.5GB / Switch 16.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0ee8f8466e61a8e50034e6c4ce5ef0ef9451c8bb40195f27e0bf720855ea1ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/27c43a4d62ab02bc49ca9b7427cfe65a5a3ca4192cef2b99858329fd25310f2d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9bd5b1a7e845994cfa3243018a27c3a07f5c851c1569aff40938cf0420ff3f44.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5e2818ee15ae1c2ed96671ed4cd5b2916be6d4092d7bfe258898d8b0cb481cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b834cd58cac65611036b8f684ffc3f59057389310fb7c315c8f77cdb5a6f228.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/096fcfdeb4d2567221e6f303390cfaa92334475d8b6b3b99f0ef1053b13378ec.jpg"],"titleId":"010034a020a5c000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000068556","name":"GGST 額外DLC角色 #15「維諾姆」","img":"ffe673f3aa4bba79271d04b6522dd69cd5d7b45796b78221a51d94fd7a481740","date":"2026-04-30","mem":false},{"id":"70050000068645","name":"GGST 額外DLC角色 #16「遊妮咔」","img":"29f05a5ee9a65b470bfb6aeecd6c5207bd31054cc7e13c46b55a859fc30bbd21","date":"2026-04-30","mem":false},{"id":"70050000068646","name":"GGST 額外DLC角色 #17「露西」","img":"d8a5d2c6d7d335999b654a626f098c7828367a606f13a04b267a0c88f74eba0e","date":"2026-04-30","mem":false},{"id":"70050000069565","name":"GGST 追加角色顏色包","img":"5dc359bf99fd33e3c103e7146cb373b57929aef627371b57f9f0ad6064818bfa","date":"2026-